        "value": "0.87",
        "provenance": "derived",
        "source": "Razorpay, 'Payment Success Rate Optimization India' (2026 guide)",
        "note": "UPI 'drops to 80-85% when a major bank's servers choke at peak', against a 93% healthy baseline: 0.825/0.93 ~= 0.887, rounded down slightly."
